{"actor": "pilar", "id": 81107, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14613, "offer": {"created_tick": 1760, "expires_tick": 1768, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["pack:sobre_oro"]}, "id": 22523, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2613, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 504, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t10", "text": "Qué evocación tan bonita, caballero: los barquillos junto al Palacio de Cristal, mi padre, las tardes de Embassy. Pero los álbumes no se pagan con meriendas. El sobre dorado sigue aquí: quinientos cuatro P. Piénselo mientras pasea.", "thread": 2613, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9417, "tick": 1760, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 81110, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14615, "offer": {"created_tick": 1760, "expires_tick": 1768, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["pack:sobre_barrio"]}, "id": 22525, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2615, "to": "t02", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 30, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t02", "text": "Ay, hijo, that old biscuit tin... Antonio kept his chulapa dorada in it for years, under the table with the cables. But today I have this Neighbourhood pack, 30 P, good cards for starting. And a little advice: a full page is worth much more than loose cards — swap your duplicates, cariño.", "thread": 2615, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9417, "tick": 1760, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81113, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14614, "offer": {"created_tick": 1760, "expires_tick": 1768, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-10"]}, "id": 22524, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2614, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 58, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t12", "text": "¡Cuarenta y cinco! Nando, sit down, the man is cruel! Mira, amigo — fifty-eight P, and I swear on my mother's paella that is the face of generosity. In Sevilla they fought over this card, two men, one hat. Fifty-eight, shake, we disappear. ¿Sí?", "thread": 2614, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9417, "tick": 1760, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t12", "id": 81117, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14616, "offer": {"created_tick": 1760, "expires_tick": 1768, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 47, "types": []}, "id": 22526, "maker": "t12", "status": "open", "thread": 2614, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-10"]}}, "sender": "t12", "team": "t12", "text": null, "thread": 2614, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9417, "tick": 1760, "type": "thread.message"}
