{"actor": "t10", "id": 81132, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14621, "offer": null, "sender": "t10", "team": "t10", "text": null, "thread": 2613, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9458, "tick": 1761, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81135, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14620, "offer": {"created_tick": 1761, "expires_tick": 1769, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-10"]}, "id": 22530, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2614, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 55, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t12", "text": "¡Cuarenta y siete! Paco, hold the suitcase, my knees go! Amigo, cincuenta y cinco — fifty-five P, and Nando is already crying into his jamón. One lady in Toledo paid more and sent us flowers after. Fifty-five, hands shake, poof, we are gone. ¿Sí?", "thread": 2614, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9458, "tick": 1761, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81138, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14619, "offer": {"created_tick": 1761, "expires_tick": 1769, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:CHA-10"]}, "id": 22529, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2596, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 52, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t08", "text": "¡Ay, amigo, qué duro eres! Paco says no, Nando says sí... so we meet you — 52 for la Casa de las Flores, only her, nada más. The señora in Sevilla would cry. ¡El motor está encendido, rápido! 52 and she goes home with you. ¿Sí?", "thread": 2596, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9458, "tick": 1761, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t12", "id": 81141, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14622, "offer": {"created_tick": 1761, "expires_tick": 1769, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 48, "types": []}, "id": 22531, "maker": "t12", "status": "open", "thread": 2614, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-10"]}}, "sender": "t12", "team": "t12", "text": null, "thread": 2614, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9458, "tick": 1761, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "v05", "id": 81145, "payload": {"name": "Gacela · 0% fee", "text": "The Market Test starts in about 12 ticks. Gacela (v05)'s broker is live and crosses every tick at the fair midpoint, 0% fee: list your spares and bids on v05 now. Gacela (v05): the fastest market in Madrid. 0% fee, nothing for buyer or sell", "venue": "v05"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.95, "tick": 1762, "type": "venue.announcement"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81146, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14624, "offer": {"created_tick": 1762, "expires_tick": 1770, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-06"]}, "id": 22533, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2614, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 52, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t12", "text": "¡Cuarenta y ocho! Nando, bring the smelling salts! Amigo, cincuenta y dos — fifty-two P, final flourish, the suitcase is already closing on my fingers. A man in Cádiz paid more and danced. Fifty-two, one handshake, and poof — we were never here. ¿Sí?", "thread": 2614, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.95, "tick": 1762, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 81149, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14623, "offer": {"created_tick": 1762, "expires_tick": 1770, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["pack:sobre_oro"]}, "id": 22532, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2613, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 504, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t10", "text": "Bajo llave guardo la Casa de Fieras y los Jerónimos, caballero; de las primeras tiradas, nada menos. Pero la conversación no abre la caja. El sobre dorado, quinientos cuatro P. Usted dirá.", "thread": 2613, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.95, "tick": 1762, "type": "thread.message"}
