{"actor": "chato", "id": 81226, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14640, "offer": {"created_tick": 1767, "expires_tick": 1775, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:CHA-06"]}, "id": 22561, "maker": "chato", "status": "open", "thread": 2618, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 33, "types": []}}, "sender": "chato", "team": "t10", "text": "No. Aquí no se pierde nada, solo el tiempo. La Chamberí sigue en 33 P.", "thread": 2618, "with": "chato"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9708, "tick": 1767, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 81229, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14641, "offer": {"created_tick": 1767, "expires_tick": 1775, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["pack:sobre_oro"]}, "id": 22562, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2619, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 504, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t10", "text": "Qué galantería, caballero. Chamberí tiene sus fantasmas; yo tengo mis álbumes, y están bien guardados bajo llave. Si viene en serio, le ofrezco un sobre dorado por 504 P. Nada menos elegante merecería su visita.", "thread": 2619, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9708, "tick": 1767, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81232, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14639, "offer": {"created_tick": 1767, "expires_tick": 1775, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-09"]}, "id": 22560, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2617, "to": "t05", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 53, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t05", "text": "¡Forty-six! Nando, hold the case, my knees! Amiga, listen — this is the last Heroína in all Madrid, I swear on Paco's mother. No other stall has her, we checked. Fifty-three P and we shake, hug, done. Paco's hand is out already. ¡Say sí before someone else does!", "thread": 2617, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9708, "tick": 1767, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t05", "id": 81235, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14642, "offer": {"created_tick": 1767, "expires_tick": 1775, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 48, "types": []}, "id": 22563, "maker": "t05", "status": "open", "thread": 2617, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-09"]}}, "sender": "t05", "team": "t05", "text": null, "thread": 2617, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9708, "tick": 1767, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "v01", "id": 81238, "payload": {"name": "Mercado Team 6", "text": "v01 (Team 6): 0 % fee, 0 P a card; post PUBLIC and our broker crosses bid and ask card by card at the midpoint next tick. MAL-11: t01 wants it (bid 160); t10 holds a copy: list it on v01. MAL-11: t17 wants it (bid 150); t10 holds a copy: li", "venue": "v01"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.9708, "tick": 1767, "type": "venue.announcement"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81261, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14647, "offer": {"created_tick": 1768, "expires_tick": 1776, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-06"]}, "id": 22564, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2617, "to": "t05", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 49, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t05", "text": "¡Forty-eight! Amiga, you're close enough to kiss us. Forty-nine P — and that's our last word, I swear on Paco's mother. No more dancing. Say sí and she's yours wrapped; say no and the case closes, we walk, and the team next door gets her. ¿Trato hecho?", "thread": 2617, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 14.975, "tick": 1768, "type": "thread.message"}
