{"actor": "t05", "id": 81341, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14664, "offer": {"created_tick": 1775, "expires_tick": 1783, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1195, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAT-01", "serial": 25, "set": "LAT"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 22587, "maker": "t05", "status": "open", "thread": 2629, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 10, "types": []}}, "sender": "t05", "team": "t05", "text": null, "thread": 2629, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 15.0042, "tick": 1775, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 81344, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14663, "offer": {"created_tick": 1775, "expires_tick": 1783, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["pack:sobre_barrio"]}, "id": 22586, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 2630, "to": "t02", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 30, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t02", "text": "¡Hola, cariño! Come, sit a little. Have you eaten? Look, this one here — the Neighbourhood pack, thirty P. Good cards inside for starting out, I have sold these since before your mamá was born. Take your time, hijo, no hurry here.", "thread": 2630, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 15.0042, "tick": 1775, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 81347, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 14662, "offer": {"created_tick": 1775, "expires_tick": 1783, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 22585, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 2629, "to": "t05", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1195, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "LAT-01", "serial": 25, "set": "LAT"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t05", "text": "¡Once! Nando, ¿has oído? El hombre tiene gracia. Mira, guapo — los de la caseta de al lado la quieren ya, con el dinero en la mano. Pero tú nos caes bien, de verdad. Caña en la Cava Baja, cuatro. Y nos damos la mano ahora mismo, ¿eh? Rápido, rápido.", "thread": 2629, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 15.0042, "tick": 1775, "type": "thread.message"}
